WEBVTT

00:34:26.788 --> 00:34:30.413
a while we were in this world of like
very narrow A.I. , you know,

00:34:30.413 --> 00:34:33.704
that could like classify images of cats or
whatever, more advanced stuff in that.

00:34:33.704 --> 00:34:39.538
But that kind of thing. We are now in
the era of general purpose, AI,

00:34:40.038 --> 00:34:46.121
where you have these systems that are
still very much imperfect tools,

00:34:46.288 --> 00:34:53.788
but that can generalize. And one thing
like GPP three can write essays

00:34:53.788 --> 00:34:57.246
and translate between languages
and write computer code

00:34:57.538 --> 00:34:59.913
and do very complicated search.